<title>SPAIN: SOCCER SHOWCASE-BETTING ON REAL MADRID V REAL BETIS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-BETTING ON REAL MADRID V REAL BETIS.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Hill betting on</p>
